          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>投掷 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntSticky001]{黏性炸弹}（或等效）。命中后依物品结算；她称之为开场彩蛋。</p>"
